  "prefLabel": "Pda 101.01 Associated facilities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 101.01 “Associated facilities” means “associated facilities” as defined in RSA 12-G:2, IV-a, namely, “all property owned or operated by the authority in the vicinity of a state-owned commercial pier, including, but not limited to, roadways, access ways, parking lots, buildings and other structures, boat ramps, equipment, and utilities.”\n\nSource. #7847, eff 3-8-03; ss by # 8146, eff 8-28-04; ss by #8760, eff 11-18-06",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pda100-700.html"
